  "correct": "4",
  "solution": "Given equation: 24 ÷ 15 × 16 + 4 - 18 = 66.\n\nBODMAS Table: \n\n [IMAGE: https://cdn.repeatermock.com/tb/d50192f098c21078501d30eeafe1a8c64bc30dd9621c48caa8a39ffc60f68b64.png] \n\nLet's check each option one by one.\n\nOption 1) ÷ and ×\n\nGiven: 24 ÷ 15 × 16 + 4 - 18 = 66\n\nAfter interchanging the signs we get;\n\n⇒ 24 × __**15 ÷ 16**__ + 4 - 18 = 66\n\n⇒ __**24 × 0.93**__ + 4 - 18 = 66\n\n⇒ __**22.32 + 4**__ - 18 = 66\n\n⇒ __26.32** - 18**__ = 66\n\n⇒ 8.32 ≠ 66\n\n⇒ LHS ≠ RHS\n\nOption 2) - and +\n\nGiven: 24 ÷ 15 × 16 + 4 - 18 = 66\n\nAfter interchanging the signs we get;\n\n⇒ __**24 ÷ 15**__ × 16 - 4 + 18 = 66\n\n⇒ __**1.6 × 16**__ - 4 + 18 = 66\n\n⇒ __25.6__ - 4 __**+ 18**__ = 66\n\n⇒ __43.6 - 4__ = 66\n\n⇒ 39.6 ≠ 66\n\n⇒ LHS ≠ RHS\n\nOption 3) - and × \n\nGiven: 24 ÷ 15 × 16 + 4 - 18 = 66\n\nAfter interchanging the signs we get;\n\n⇒ __**24 ÷ 15**__ - 16 + 4 × 18 = 66\n\n⇒ 1.6 - 16 + __**4 × 18**__ = 66\n\n⇒ __**1.6**__ - 16 __**+ 72**__ = 66\n\n⇒ 73.6 - 16 = 66\n\n⇒ 57.6 ≠ 66\n\n⇒ LHS ≠ RHS\n\n**Option 4) ÷ and +**\n\nGiven: 24 ÷ 15 × 16 + 4 - 18 = 66\n\nAfter interchanging the signs we get;\n\n⇒ 24 + 15 × __**16 ÷ 4**__ - 18 = 66\n\n⇒ 24 + __**15 × 4**__ - 18 = 66\n\n⇒ __**24 + 60**__ - 18 = 66\n\n⇒ __84 - 18__ = 66\n\n⇒** 66 = 66**\n\n**⇒ LHS = RHS**\n\nHence, the correct answer is \"Option 4\".",
